+Every ticket has a private support-domain reply address. Replies from the requester reopen pending or solved email tickets, while mail to the plain business address always opens a new ticket. Replies to closed tickets are ignored. Staff public replies to email-origin tickets are emailed to the requester with the private address as `Reply-To`; private notes and portal-origin tickets remain in-app only.
 
